# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS libc++ 缺失标准头 <memory_resource>/<source_location> ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-03
# Software: jsonifier 0.9.97
# Gate: conan create / 消费者编译（OHOS aarch64）
# Status: UNMATCHED — 相关 E130（libcxx-ohos 标准库）但未覆盖具体缺失头，待 promote
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-jsonifier-ohos-libcxx-missing-std-headers
severity: 2
category: platform, portability, headers
trigger_tool: clang|clang++
phase: compilation
approach: <memory_resource> 用 __has_include 守卫（仅需要类型时才包含）；<source_location>
  提供 API 等价的 Compat shim 头（file_name/function_name/line/column/current，基于
  __builtin_FILE/FUNCTION/LINE），并用 `__has_include(<source_location>)` 决定用标准库
  还是 shim；补丁落盘，不引入第三方依赖

keywords: memory_resource, source_location, libcxx-ohos, OHOS, missing header, shim, __has_include

error_signature: 'memory_resource' file not found|'source_location' file not found|no type named 'source_location' in namespace 'std'
match_keywords: memory_resource,source_location,file not found,libcxx-ohos,OHOS,missing header

root_cause: OHOS SDK（ohos-sdk_26.0.0.18）的 libcxx-ohos 定制 libc++ 头集合
  （libcxx-ohos/include/c++/v1/）不提供标准 <memory_resource>（仅有
  experimental/memory_resource）与 <source_location>；依赖这两个头的库直接编译失败
affected_scope: 任意 C++17/C++20 库落地 OHOS aarch64 时若直接 include 这两个标准头；
  jsonifier 0.9.97 适配实测（E130 仅覆盖"变更 -std 标准"层面，未列出具体缺失头，
  属新增差异）

prescan_pattern: #include\s*[<"]memory_resource[>"]|#include\s*[<"]source_location[>"]

prescan_globs: "*.h, *.hpp, *.c, *.cc, *.cpp"
